# [CRITICAL] tailwind-breakpoint-shadowing.md:
#   - NEVER use bare `lg:` for responsive layout
#   - USE `lg-desktop:` and `lg-touch:` for 1024px+ breakpoints
#   - Default `md:`, `xs:` are safe (no custom shadows)
#   - Verify: tailwind.config.ts screens section confirmed 2026-04-01
#
# [HIGH] functional-grouping.md:
#   - Complete functional groups together, not isolated components
#   - Ship coherent units: Product Display → Filter System → Polish
#
# [HIGH] velocity-aware-sprint-planning.md:
#   - Each SC verifiable in <5 min (npm run build)
#   - No re-planning during execution
#   - Single agent window per scope
#
# [HIGH] pre-flight-baseline-check.md:
#   - Verify npm run build PASSES before any changes
#
# [HIGH] type-consolidation.md:
#   - Use Pick<SanityProduct, ...> pattern, not manual interfaces

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SCOPE LOCK RULES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ❌ NO globals.css changes
# ❌ NO homepage component changes
# ❌ NO data structure / GROQ query changes
# ❌ NO Sanity schema changes
# ❌ NO tailwind.config.ts changes
# ❌ NO new dependencies
# ❌ NO improvements outside scope contracts
# ❌ NO bare `lg:` breakpoint classes (use lg-desktop:/lg-touch:)

