# REGRESSION CONTAINMENT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# | File                          | Risk              | Mitigation                    |
# |-------------------------------|-------------------|-------------------------------|
# | page.tsx (layout)             | Scroll model change breaks sidebar/main relationship | Build gate after SC1 |
# | ProductCard.tsx               | Card layout change could break mobile stacking       | Build gate after SC3 |
# | ProductImage.tsx              | Image sizing change could break aspect ratios         | Build gate after SC2 |
# | ProductGrid.tsx               | Column count change affects card sizing               | Build gate after SC4 |
# | FilterSidebar.tsx             | Removing sticky/hidden could break layout             | Build gate after SC5 |
# | SortDropdown.tsx              | Navigation change could break sort functionality      | Build gate after SC6 |
# | MobileFilterDrawer.tsx        | Checkbox swap could break filter toggling             | Build gate after SC8 |
# | CategoryPageClient.tsx        | Semantic tag change must not break nesting            | Build gate after SC10|

# Pre-sprint regression test:
# npx vitest run --reporter=verbose (if tests exist for these components)
# npm run build (baseline gate)

