## SC1: Page Layout — Natural Scroll & Spacing [G8, G9, G18, G22]

### Files
# (store)/products/[...slug]/page.tsx

### Target State
# - Natural document scroll (no custom scroll container)
# - Sidebar sticky with independent scroll
# - max-w-content (1280px) constraint
# - Responsive padding: px-4 md:px-8
# - Bottom padding: pb-12

### Changes (Exact)
# 1. Outer div: REMOVE h-[calc(100vh-var(--desktop-header-h))]
# 2. Outer div: CHANGE "container mx-auto px-4 pb-6" → "mx-auto max-w-content px-4 md:px-8 pb-12"
# 3. Flex div: REMOVE "h-full overflow-hidden"
# 4. Aside: CHANGE "hidden lg:block w-60 shrink-0 pt-6 h-full overflow-y-auto scrollbar-none"
#         → "hidden lg-desktop:block lg-touch:block w-60 shrink-0 sticky top-[var(--desktop-header-h)] h-[calc(100vh-var(--desktop-header-h))] overflow-y-auto scrollbar-none pt-6"
# 5. Main: CHANGE "flex-1 min-w-0 h-full overflow-y-auto scrollbar-none"
#       → "flex-1 min-w-0 pt-6"

### DoD
# - [ ] L2: Outer container has max-w-content, responsive px, pb-12
# - [ ] L2: Flex container has no overflow-hidden, no fixed height
# - [ ] L2: Sidebar sticky with calc height, independent overflow scroll
# - [ ] L2: Main content scrolls with natural document flow
# - [ ] Verify: npm run build passes
# - [ ] Verify: Desktop — sidebar sticks on scroll, main scrolls naturally
# - [ ] Verify: Mobile — sidebar hidden, full-width content

### Delegation
# /implement SC1 from SPRINT_2026_04_01_PLP_DESIGN_ALIGNMENT
# Build gate: npm run build

