## SC3: ProductCard — Align with Homepage Pattern [G1, G6, G13]

### Files
# app/components/features/products/ProductCard.tsx

### Target State
# Card layout matches homepage FeaturedCard:
# - Figure has p-6 internal padding
# - Image has group-hover:scale-110
# - Product name uses type-body font-medium (not type-card-title)
# - Price and cart button in horizontal flex row (not stacked)
# - Cart button is compact inline (not full-width)
# - Redundant text-priceTag removed from price

### Changes (Exact)
# 1. Figure: ADD p-6
#    FROM: "aspect-[4/3] relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-surface-productImage"
#    TO:   "aspect-[4/3] relative flex w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-surface-productImage p-6"
# 2. ProductImage: ADD className="group-hover:scale-110"
# 3. Content div:
#    FROM: "flex flex-col flex-grow p-4"
#    TO:   "flex flex-col flex-grow gap-3 p-4"
# 4. Product name:
#    FROM: "type-card-title line-clamp-2 mb-1"
#    TO:   "type-body font-medium line-clamp-2"
# 5. Price paragraph:
#    FROM: <p className="type-price text-priceTag mb-3">
#    TO:   <p className="type-price">
# 6. Price+CTA layout — REPLACE stacked layout with flex row:
#    REMOVE: standalone <p> for price + full-width button below
#    ADD: <div className="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between pt-2">
#           <p className="type-price">${price}</p>
#           <button className="btn-cart">...</button>  (no w-full, no justify-center)
#         </div>

### DoD
# - [ ] L2: Content div has gap-3, price+CTA in flex row with justify-between
# - [ ] L3: Figure has p-6, name uses type-body font-medium, price has type-price only
# - [ ] L4: Image has group-hover:scale-110 via className prop
# - [ ] L4: Card hover shows border-brand-400 glow (from card-product-dark token)
# - [ ] Verify: npm run build passes
# - [ ] Verify: Card visually matches homepage FeaturedCard pattern

### Delegation
# /implement SC3 from SPRINT_2026_04_01_PLP_DESIGN_ALIGNMENT
# Build gate: npm run build

