# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# RWD STRATEGY
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# | Breakpoint     | Trigger                    | Grid Cols | Sidebar | Controls        |
# |----------------|----------------------------|-----------|---------|-----------------|
# | base (0px)     | Default                    | 1         | Hidden  | Mobile bar      |
# | xs (475px)     | Small phone landscape      | 2         | Hidden  | Mobile bar      |
# | md (768px)     | Tablet                     | 2         | Hidden  | Mobile bar      |
# | lg-touch       | 1024px + height ≤850px     | 2         | Visible | Desktop sort    |
# | lg-desktop     | 1024px + height >850px     | 3         | Visible | Desktop sort    |

